<title>INDIA: All banks in India closed on Thursday, says IBA.</title>
<headline>All banks in India closed on Thursday, says IBA.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks across India will be closed on Thursday, January 23, in connection with the birth centenary of the late freedom fighter Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose, the Indian Banks Association (IBA) said.</p>
<p>&quot;The day is also a holiday under the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881,&quot; an IBA statement on Wednesday said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
